Keyword arguments:
    interpolation (str): interpolation method to use when the desired quantile lies between two data points.
                            Can be ``linear``, ``lower``, ``higher``, ``midpoint`` and ``nearest``.
                            Default is ``linear``.
    out (Tensor, optional): the output tensor.

